            "start_line": 12,
            "end_line": 13,
            "line_count": 2,
            "preview": "// Command line with multiple -D key=value pairs (and a bare -D) plus a long --property option final String[] args = { \"-Dparam1=value1\", \"-Dparam2=value2\", \"-Dparam3\", \"-Dparam4=value4\", \"-D\", \"--property\", \"foo=bar\" };"
          },
          {
            "start_line": 15,
            "end_line": 17,
            "line_count": 3,
            "preview": "final Options options = new Options(); options.addOption(Option.builder(\"D\").valueSeparator().optionalArg(true).numberOfArgs(2).get()); options.addOption(Option.builder().valueSeparator().numberOfArgs(2).longOpt(\"property\").get());"
          },
          {
            "start_line": 19,
            "end_line": 20,
            "line_count": 2,
            "preview": "final Parser parser = new GnuParser(); final CommandLine cl = parser.parse(options, args);"
          },
          {
            "start_line": 22,
            "end_line": 29,
            "line_count": 8,
            "preview": "// Verify all -D key=value pairs are extracted; a bare key (param3) maps to \"true\" final Properties props = cl.getOptionProperties(\"D\"); assertNotNull(props, \"null properties\");"
